		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A wagon-sized, coral-colored orchid surrounded by dagger- sized thorn vines. The orchid's central stigma is shaped like an alluring, green-skinned humanoid.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 vine +7 (1d10), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Feed</strong>. As an action, feed on helpless or unconscious victim, who loses 1d6 INT and CON permanently. Alraune regains 3d6 HP after feeding.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fragrance</strong>. All mortals within double hear, CHA 15+ or cannot take hostile actions.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
